      "text": "1. this serialize all data \nwhen save happens\n2. and Actually make save files for it.\n3. Load them and \ndistribute when load happens\n\nplyaerdata -> player.tscb\n\n\ntilledSoilData -> scene/tilemapTilledSoil/tilledsoilComponent.gd\ninventoryData -> globals/inventory\nobjectsData -> scene/objects/objectsComponentData",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. this serialize all data \nwhen save happens\n2. and Actually make save files for it.\n3. Load them and \ndistribute when load happens\n\nplyaerdata -> player.tscb\n\n\ntilledSoilData -> scene/tilemapTilledSoil/tilledsoilComponent.gd\ninventoryData -> globals/inventory\nobjectsData -> scene/objects/objectsComponentData",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
